        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Marini’s power packs are hydraulic power units designed to drive drilling equipment and other heavy machinery in the construction and civil engineering industry. They are built to deliver stable hydraulic power in demanding environments and are both robust and efficient. These power units can be configured with different engine options, diesel engine or electric motor, depending on specific needs and conditions. See the table below for specifications or download the brochure below."
